   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ながら: two things at once",
     "texto": [
      "With the -ます stem (without ます) + **ながら** you say you do two things **at the same time**: **おんがく を きき ながら** (listening to music).",
      "Both actions must have the same subject (done by the same person)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜た ばかり: having just done",
     "texto": [
      "**Past verb + ばかり** shows that, from the speaker's point of view, the action happened recently: **にほん から かえった ばかり です** (I've just come back from Japan). It doesn't fix how long «recently» is; it depends on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
